        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_hotspot_chamomile",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HotspotChamomile_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Picking:</b> Pick gives 1 to 2 Chamomile and uses up a quarter of the patch. The Ripeness bar must be at least a quarter full to pick, so a patch picked clean has to be left alone for a while.\n\n<b>Regrowth:</b> Ripeness refills in about 7 days from empty, so a full patch gives 4 pickings. It does not regrow in winter. The 7 days and the quarter-sized pickings are tunable placeholder numbers.\n\n<b>Where:</b> This patch stays at its place on the map. Placeholder art."
    },
